<!--
    Test dataset for LabResultsSectionTest.

    Lab results are anchored on obs whose concept class is a "lab" class. The section
    resolves the configured class names (default "Test,LabSet") to ids and keeps only
    obs in those classes; vitals-style observations (class "Finding") are excluded.

    Concept classes come from standardTestDataset:
      concept_class_id=1  Test
      concept_class_id=8  LabSet
      concept_class_id=5  Finding   (used to prove vitals are NOT rendered as labs)
    Concept datatypes: 1=Numeric, 2=Coded, 3=Text, 4=N/A.

    Concept IDs 9001-9018 avoid conflicts with vitals (5001-5009), diagnoses (6001-6003),
    allergies (7001-7006) and conditions (8001-8002). Visit/encounter/obs IDs 501+ / 9101+.

    Visit 501 — patient 2, one encounter with:
      Glucose (9001) 9.5, interpretation HIGH, no obs-level range
                       -> range from ConceptNumeric normals "4 – 7 mmol/L", flag "High"
      Hemoglobin (9002) 8.0, interpretation LOW, obs-level reference range 12–16
                       -> range from the per-obs snapshot "12 – 16 g/dL", flag "Low"
      Malaria Smear (9003) coded = Positive (9004) -> value "Positive", blank range
      Culture Notes (9005) text -> value text, blank range
      Weight (9009, class Finding) -> excluded from labs
      Complete Blood Count (9006, class LabSet) obs group with members
        WBC (9007) 6.5 and Platelets (9008) 250 -> rendered as a grouped panel
      A voided Glucose (9001) obs -> excluded
    Visit 502 — patient 7, encounter with no obs (None recorded)
    Visit 503 — patient 2, one encounter exercising range/interpretation edges:
      Sodium (9010) low-bound-only -> "≥ 135 mmol/L"; Total Bilirubin (9011) high-bound-only
      -> "≤ 1.2 mg/dL"; Potassium (9012) interpretation NORMAL -> no flag; Lactate (9013)
      no bounds/snapshot -> blank range and flag
    Visit 504 — patient 8, no encounters (empty early-return path)
    Visit 505 — patient 2, one encounter exercising numeric formatting and flag localization:
      TSH (9014) 0.04 -> "0.04"; HIV Viral Load (9015) 3000000000 -> "3000000000"; Serum
      Amylase (9016) no value + HIGH -> placeholder "—" with no units, flag kept; Ferritin
      (9017) OFF_SCALE_HIGH -> flag via message key "Off-scale High"; Aerobic Culture (9018)
      RESISTANT -> unmapped, falls back to "Resistant"; Basic Metabolic Panel (9019, LabSet)
      with one member whose concept (9020) has NO name -> member renders "Unknown";
      a panel whose own concept (9021) has NO name -> heading renders "Unknown"; a
      standalone result whose concept (9022) has NO name -> name renders "Unknown"
-->
